---
import ServiceLayout from '../layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<ServiceLayout
  title="Plumbing Repairs"
  description={`Plumbing repairs in Asheville & Hendersonville, NC: leaks, clogged drains, running toilets, faucets, valves and more from licensed plumbers. Call ${site.phone} for a free estimate.`}
  heroTitle="Plumbing Repairs Done Right the First Time"
  heroSubtitle="Leaks, clogs and broken fixtures fixed promptly by licensed plumbers in Asheville, Hendersonville, NC and the surrounding areas."
  heroImage="/images/gallery/under-sink-valve-repair.jpg"
  listHeading="Common Repairs We Handle:"
  listItems={[
    'Leaking pipes, faucets and fittings',
    'Clogged or slow drains',
    'Running, leaking or clogged toilets',
    'Shut-off and pressure valves',
    'Low or uneven water pressure',
    'Shower and tub valves and fixtures',
    'Frozen or burst pipes',
    'Water heater, sump pump and ejector pump repair',
  ]}
  listNote="Not sure what's wrong? Describe the problem when you call and we'll tell you what to expect."
  ctaHeading="Need Something Fixed?"
  photosHeading="Recent Repair Work"
  photos={[
    { src: '/images/gallery/under-sink-valve-repair.jpg', alt: 'Plumbers replacing a valve under a bathroom sink in Asheville, NC', caption: 'Replacing a valve under a bathroom sink' },
    { src: '/images/gallery/shower-fixture-install.jpg', alt: 'Shower head and hand shower installed on green tile in Asheville, NC', caption: 'Shower fixture and hand shower install' },
    { src: '/images/gallery/gallery-01.jpg', alt: 'Commercial water heater installation in Asheville, NC', caption: 'Commercial water heater work' },
  ]}
>
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal-900 sm:text-3xl">Plumbing Repairs</h2>
  <p>
    A small leak or a slow drain rarely stays small. Nesbitt's Plumbing tracks down the cause,
    explains what we found in plain terms, and fixes it properly so you're not calling us back for
    the same problem next month. We're fully licensed and insured, and same-day appointments are
    often available.
  </p>
  <p>
    From a dripping faucet to a pipe that let go inside a wall, our plumbers have
    {site.yearsInBusiness} years of experience with homes and businesses across Asheville and
    Hendersonville, NC. If the job turns out to be bigger than a repair, like a failing water or
    sewer line, we have the crews and equipment to handle that too.
  </p>
  <p>
    Call <a href={site.phoneHref} class="font-semibold text-drop-600 hover:underline">{site.phone}</a>
    for a free estimate.
  </p>
</ServiceLayout>
